EXPERIMENT 05 — EGRESS CONTROL
Target: httpbin.org
Authorized workload: order-service
Policy: GET /get only

$ kubectl get serviceentry,authorizationpolicy -n istio-egress
NAME                                           HOSTS             LOCATION   RESOLUTION   AGE
serviceentry.networking.istio.io/httpbin-org   ["httpbin.org"]              DNS          20s

NAME                                                        ACTION   AGE
authorizationpolicy.security.istio.io/httpbin-allow-order   ALLOW    20s

$ kubectl get gateway -n istio-egress
NAME       CLASS            ADDRESS       PROGRAMMED   AGE
waypoint   istio-waypoint   10.96.4.137   True         60s

$ kubectl exec deployment/order-service -- DNS and HTTP checks

DNS CHECK: httpbin.org
DNS RESULT: RESOLVED
ADDRESSES: 2001:2::1, 240.240.0.1

TEST: Allowed endpoint
REQUEST: GET http://httpbin.org/get
HTTP 200
EXPECTED: HTTP 200
RESPONSE: {   "args": {},   "headers": {     "Accept-Encoding": "identity",     "Host": "httpbin.org",     "User-Agent": "Python-urllib/3.12"   },   "method": "GET",   "o
RESULT: MATCHED

TEST: Denied method
REQUEST: POST http://httpbin.org/post
HTTP 403
EXPECTED: HTTP 403
RESPONSE: RBAC: access denied
RESULT: MATCHED

TEST: Denied path
REQUEST: GET http://httpbin.org/headers
HTTP 403
EXPECTED: HTTP 403
RESPONSE: RBAC: access denied
RESULT: MATCHED

SUMMARY: 3 of 3 HTTP checks matched
